notes:        Unmodified 1040x736 GDI capture from code commit d4a2b76521eb5cbcfe4daf2c593eeb859b291b32. Windows 2025 hosted runner, Microsoft Basic Render Driver (software DX12). The saved synthetic.ecproj opened and its composition, checker, blue background, layers and timeline were visible. The GPU compositor's classic3d shader initialization failed on this software adapter; this image proves the editor and 2D preview drew, not GPU effects or interactive editing.
